Package: coolboxr
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for CoolBox
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("CoolBox", "Maintainers", email = "opensource@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Minimal R bindings for selected CoolBox C++ components.
    The initial package exposes linear regression helpers backed by the
    existing native implementation and is set up for roxygen2 and pkgdown.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    devtools,
    pkgdown,
    roxygen2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
